{"id":"wb-8-327","name":"芷溪宗祠建筑","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"芷溪宗祠建筑","text":"芷溪宗祠建筑，位于中国福建省连城县庙前镇芷溪村。芷溪宗祠建筑有74座，结构多为“祠居合一”式，建筑形式以“九厅十八井”为主，门楼设计精美，其中最为典型的有澄川公祠、集鳣堂、黄氏家庙、翠畴公祠、杨氏家庙、杨辉公祠等，2009年被列为第七批福建省文物保护单位。2019年10月7日公布为第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8A%B7%E6%BA%AA%E5%AE%97%E7%A5%A0%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91","revisionId":86761707,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86761707","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/4d3fdc79aa4f63e1ab3c0fa6.jpg","title":"Liancheng_Zhixi_2013.10.07_11-49-28.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Liancheng_Zhixi_2013.10.07_11-49-28.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/39/Liancheng_Zhixi_2013.10.07_11-49-28.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"芷溪\n\n杨氏宗祠","width":320,"height":213}}